### ============================================================
### Audit trails (read-only)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@auditId = 1
@itemId = 1
@userId = 1

### List audit trails
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recent (limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails/recent?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by action
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails?action=created
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by user
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails?user_id={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by auditable (BorrowingRequest)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails?auditable_type=App\Models\BorrowingRequest&auditable_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by auditable (Usage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails?auditable_type=App\Models\Usage&auditable_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-trails/{{auditId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nested — audit trails for item
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}/audit-trails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
